From: CEB-GNRD maintainers <bmc@example.com>
Subject: [PATCH] webui: remove SNMP Alerts, Key clear, LDAP and Resource management

The CEB-GNRD has no SNMP trap destinations, no key-clear or LDAP support and
no BMC-side power capping, so these navigation items are removed together
with their routes.

Upstream-Status: Inappropriate [CEB-GNRD board-specific]
---
--- a/src/components/AppNavigation/AppNavigationMixin.js
+++ b/src/components/AppNavigation/AppNavigationMixin.js
@@ -88,11 +88,6 @@ const AppNavigationMixin = {
               label: i18n.global.t('appNavigation.kvm'),
               route: '/operations/kvm',
             },
-            {
-              id: 'key-clear',
-              label: i18n.global.t('appNavigation.keyClear'),
